  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PIMHIE programme responds to the urgent threats facing public interest media around the world. BBC Media Action, the BBC&#x2019;s international development organisation, will lead the Global Public Interest Media Framework, a network of specialist regional and international media partners, to deliver an adaptive, contextualised and locally-led response which contributes to healthier information environments in up to six countries.</narrative>
